
* ==========================================
* EXPERIMENT 2A - CMOS INVERTER VTC
* ==========================================

* Supply voltage
VDD VDD 0 1.8

* Input voltage (will be swept)
VIN IN 0 0

* NMOS transistor
MN OUT IN 0 0 NM W=2u L=0.18u

* PMOS transistor
MP OUT IN VDD VDD PM W=1u L=0.18u

* Generic MOSFET models
.model NM NMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=0.45 KP=200u LAMBDA=0.02)
.model PM PMOS (LEVEL=1 VTO=-0.45 KP=100u LAMBDA=0.02)

* DC voltage sweep
.dc VIN 0 1.8 1m

.save V(IN) V(OUT)

.end
